patrone-gnome-taskbar (0.3.2) resolute; urgency=medium

  * No more "already disposed" warnings when signing out: a rebuild queued
    as GNOME Shell exited touched the bar's destroyed buttons.
  * The browser, terminal, files and mail pins show the icon of the app
    they open, as the Start menu does, instead of the icon theme's
    generic one; the generic icon is only for a job no app does.

