patrone-gnome-taskbar (0.3.1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * When an update replaces the taskbar's files, a notification says to
    sign out and back in, with a Sign out button: until then the desktop
    keeps running the old taskbar, whose settings the new version's
    Patrone Settings can't change (layouts, Start icons and Royal did
    nothing after 0.3.0 was installed into a running desktop).

